hoices.**Assessing observational facts**\n\nI'm considering how initial observational facts, M, can be updated without altering dependencies, even when conditioned on hidden variables that correlate with X. It seems that a global \"all and only\" preservation could imply an override on D, but I need to ensure that there are no independent errors conditioned on current observations. My proposal doesn’t rely on evidence abduction, and it's essential to illustrate that X remains fixed during evaluation. I also wonder if certain choices at observations imply re-optimization is necessary.","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":3},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8QD6A7etOwE8pCJVVMedxeJ7LgQ04TbvF757FOCLfSNHrCz2iH5J_jFcTGh0mFd9JxJKQffXMLNWEsv3HJxE9Mnc8Pt3AsTlaLPqikM8LWUYVUzcTPwcMOEC9YzHAyMW9YS2y5ilA-Kdkm8q17h14Li5HZ35zus-Sm8vlAKZF7jZijePwmXn5iFG-UkwM-3EpAgQCIYuZMgwS6I2DB1EO6iicyZ6ZoGW6FnZf8P01QojB2CICqn9BdAbZPfCXp-RFJ1vnvjoEELpSxO3mO8btqbqVpwtFeakRjxGfZYeYXatcsNEzSlaYBV03_Lc1FDaxK6i2bk3xPT6fIbP_QTVDhvZC3Hq6ttctoGue2OcH9EQ4tUwZFUW2AGioO9MDLlS5kZW_xzaMhtMelciahyRVzTqevJuJCI2ZWKcCgLiZam_bQTqbH12d7fwlL28fsXxCQitdQFNXttrhfU3QyYCT_HG_lVp-nKOgDgYCbLwqNHRhJlft938XWFuhfFME02zsmtvUgyM-vEKEAeam5ngoW4qsZ6YjdST6k04PvHHdM3xRwMyalEVGDWdpv_yjSClQs32z_yeCQj4AE2HRqcHhELnF6AYpNE7iXFZRQjKYnz6jCdwDYA_DQjUsELZVXnn6vA6Eidmgm13DW29UbL8yTs-1BO4hVyRp-6SDk2zB4XtopUMffnJ5Nm4uukYS9L4SQTKSByBeZFjysDVcE_b0ululEgajLU6JkmqV9CyvHCqp-5b6S2ZJkHc6zSSkYEkJsBcKwXLed6jbABNFBT8t2-Cl2VS7pyPurnng5t7Nk_h1yysdjtacdCEIv10ZNXw_UykicSPLH9Aqetsrb33Jd_oRq1nNm3dK9SEnejU-qVND3WF9CK1c_bh1WHTEJIv3pRhlmTTy1E9tGobAr3Tf3vbZCcVsyWfFPgiirc2TMMrILkGat0ceUrWVioEbXBgv1U37vFoUUgrqUNOxQix9TyURXbNAfxTMxcLeynhtytJdfQ6mPavEwYs5m9hJZA2WiKe79rpSwiDl6U8gGZhNe8C4lMsRPlwOulS6I-A_32gpHzehKsJchbKOK023Yhv5-v1w-9fDdOy4kdiRsndMK2J24zM6P4lC_qVS9Q0xETv9pTjEnyaobK-XUuK7ccew76BTifQZBDvtcaOEusIG6eIg03Y-9w2kfzKQv-lEV5gqlX_wfsOBTFWL5HmKPfIKfwqL5l7R5Fj-ySGBTdS-JgAMlcGuC5wvjnERWB23BKPymcZMX1y0ci7QqcrgOu-VEPIJI6KNbCtQGVhNe4KN4xR15kfmIxsFDy_zEy5